  "text": "Tour Packages - Domestic & International | Prestige Holidays 4U Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Home Domestic International Packages Customize Trip About Contact +91 63618 77187 Our Tour Packages Carefully curated packages designed to give you the best travel experiences Domestic Packages Standard Goa Family Holiday 4 Nights / 5 Days Families Relaxing beach holiday perfect for families with kids. Enjoy pristine beaches, water sports, and delicious seafood while creating unforgettable memories. Highlights: Visit famous beaches - Baga, Calangute & Anjuna Water sports activities included Family-friendly accommodations Enquire on WhatsApp Luxury Kerala Backwaters Tour 5 Nights / 6 Days Couples Experience serene backwaters and nature in God&#x27;s Own Country. Includes houseboat stays, tea plantation visits, and Ayurvedic wellness treatments. Highlights: Luxury houseboat stay in Alleppey Munnar tea plantation tour Traditional Ayurvedic spa treatment Enquire on WhatsApp Premium Rajasthan Heritage Tour 6 Nights / 7 Days All Discover the royal heritage of Rajasthan. Visit majestic forts, opulent palaces, and experience the vibrant culture of the land of kings. Highlights: Jaipur - Amber Fort & City Palace Udaipur - Lake Palace & boat ride Jodhpur - Mehrangarh Fort tour Enquire on WhatsApp Standard Sikkim Himalayan Adventure 5 Nights / 6 Days Adventure Seekers Discover the pristine beauty of the Eastern Himalayas with stunning mountain views, Buddhist monasteries, and serene alpine lakes in Sikkim. Highlights: Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir visit Gangtok city tour & ropeway Rumtek Monastery exploration Enquire on WhatsApp International Packages Luxury Dubai Luxury Tour 5 Nights / 6 Days Couples Luxury shopping, desert safari, and city tour. Experience the glitz and glamour of Dubai with visits to iconic landmarks and world-class attractions. Highlights: Burj Khalifa at the Top experience Desert safari with BBQ dinner Dubai Mall & Gold Souk shopping Enquire on WhatsApp Premium Switzerland Romantic Escape 6 Nights / 7 Days Couples Romantic Swiss Alps and scenic train journeys. Perfect for couples seeking breathtaking mountain views, charming villages, and unforgettable experiences. Highlights: Jungfraujoch - Top of Europe Scenic Glacier Express train ride Lake Geneva & Chateau de Chillon Enquire on WhatsApp Premium Paris & French Riviera 7 Nights / 8 Days All Explore the City of Love and the glamorous French Riviera. Experience world-class art, cuisine, and Mediterranean beaches in this ultimate France tour. Highlights: Eiffel Tower & Louvre Museum Palace of Versailles day trip French Riviera - Nice & Monaco Enquire on WhatsApp Don&#x27;t See What You&#x27;re Looking For? Let us create a custom package tailored to your preferences and budget Customize Your Trip Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Your trusted partner for domestic and international travel experiences. Creating memorable journeys since years. Quick Links Home Domestic Tours International Tours Tour Packages About Us Contact Us Popular Destinations Goa Kerala Maldives Dubai Switzerland Thailand Contact Info No 638/G, HBR 1st Stage, 2nd Block, HBR Layout, Karnataka, Bengaluru – 560043 +91 63618 77187 showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com © 2026 Prestige Holidays 4U. All rights reserved. Chat with us on WhatsApp"
